    "sub_name": "財產風險與保險",
    "sub_ename": "PROPERTY RISK AND INSURANCE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹財產與責任保險之功能與保單特性。\r\n1.如何重視法治社會與責任保險之應用。\r\n2.如何展望財產與責任保險之經營。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the functions and policy features of property and liability insurance.\r\n1. How to attach importance to the rule of law society and the application of liability insurance.\r\n2. How to look forward to the operation of property and liability insurance.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
